
### Get all results
GET http://localhost:3000/results

### Create a new record
POST http://localhost:3000/results
content-type: application/json

# needs a blank line between content and body
{
"id": 20,
"fName": "Tony",
"lName": "Nicol",
"score": 39
}

### Or using url-encoding
POST http://localhost:3000/results
content-type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

id=30&fName=Jimmy&lName=Riddle&score=3

### Get a specified user. Last name. Case sensitive
GET http://localhost:3000/results/name?lName=Jet

### Delete user 20
DELETE http://localhost:3000/results/20

### Update lName of specified user by ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/results/2/Malony